# Joveo AI Dashboard UI Design System

## Core Layout Structure

### Header
```typescript
// Dark navy header with account/region controls
const Header = {
  height: "64px",
  background: "#1C2536",
  color: "#FFFFFF",
  components: {
    accountSelector: {
      font: "SF Pro Text Medium 14px",
      dropdownTrigger: true
    },
    breadcrumbs: {
      separator: "/",
      activeColor: "#E2E6F1"
    },
    regionSelector: {
      background: "#202E49",
      borderRadius: "55px"
    }
  }
}
```

### Sidebar
```typescript
